+/* packet-op47.c
+ * Free TV Australia Operational Practice OP-47, "Storage and Distribution of
+ * Teletext Subtitles and VBI Data for High Definition Television," Issue 6,
+ * May 2018; also published by SMPTE as RDD 8, "Storage and Distribution of
+ * Teletext Subtitles and VBI Data for High-Definition Television."
+ *
